activity Submit Timesheet
activity Approve Timesheet
activity Calculate Gross Pay
activity Calculate Deductions
activity Calculate Net Pay
activity Process Payment
activity Update Payroll Records
activity Review Payroll Report
activity Generate Paystub
activity Distribute Paystub
bind Submit Timesheet: Employee ID, Hours Worked, Timesheet Status
bind Approve Timesheet: Employee ID, Timesheet Status
bind Calculate Gross Pay: Employee ID, Hours Worked, Pay Rate, Gross Pay
bind Calculate Deductions: Employee ID, Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction
bind Calculate Net Pay: Employee ID, Gross Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction, Net Pay
bind Process Payment: Employee ID, Net Pay, Payment Method
bind Update Payroll Records: Employee ID, Net Pay, Payment Method
bind Review Payroll Report: Employee ID, Net Pay
bind Generate Paystub: Employee ID, Gross Pay, Net Pay, Tax Deduction, Insurance Deduction
bind Distribute Paystub: Employee ID
Employee ID: integer between 1000 and 9999
Hours Worked: integer between 0 and 80
Pay Rate: float between 10.0 and 100.0
Gross Pay: float between 0.0 and 10000.0
Tax Deduction: float between 0.0 and 5000.0
Insurance Deduction: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Net Pay: float between 0.0 and 10000.0
Timesheet Status: Submitted, Approved, Rejected
Payment Method: Direct Deposit, Check
Init[Submit Timesheet] | |
End[Distribute Paystub] | |
Response[Submit Timesheet, Approve Timesheet] | | |
Not Response[Approve Timesheet, Submit Timesheet] |A.Timesheet Status is Rejected | |
Response[Approve Timesheet, Calculate Gross Pay] |A.Timesheet Status is Approved | |
Response[Calculate Gross Pay, Calculate Deductions] | | |
Response[Calculate Deductions, Calculate Net Pay] | | |
Response[Calculate Net Pay, Process Payment] | | |
Response[Process Payment, Update Payroll Records] | | |
Response[Update Payroll Records, Review Payroll Report] | | |
Response[Review Payroll Report, Generate Paystub] | | |
Response[Generate Paystub, Distribute Paystub] | | |